Slides start aligned with the column, run past the right edge of the page, and travel right to left across the whole screen as you press the arrows or swipe.

## Math

Inline math sits in a sentence, like {% inlineMath expression="e^{i\\pi} + 1 = 0" /%}, and block math gets its own line.

{% math expression="\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx = \\frac{1}{3}" /%}

